  "notes": "{限定|げんてい} means to limit or restrict something to a specified scope or quantity.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {限定|げんてい}する (to limit, to restrict)\n- {限定|げんてい}{品|ひん} (limited-edition item)\n- {期間|きかん}{限定|げんてい} (limited time)\n- {数量|すうりょう}{限定|げんてい} (limited quantity)\n- {地域|ちいき}{限定|げんてい} (region-exclusive)\n- {会員|かいいん}{限定|げんてい} (members only)\n\nAs a modifier, {限定|げんてい} is often placed directly before a noun: {限定|げんてい}{販売|はんばい} (limited sale).",
